    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get the \"depersonalization\" thing but it feels more permanent than that. like... if everything is just digital and fake, then what's the point of trying to stay \"grounded\" in a world that isn't even there? it just makes me feel so tired. like i'm just waiting for something to end.",
